==English==
[[File:Waltdisneyco1.jpg|thumb|right|[[w:Walt Disney Studios (Burbank)|The Walt Disney Studios]], the headquarters of The Walt Disney Company.]]

===Etymology===
* From {{etyl|fro}} {{term|de|lang=fro||of, from}} + {{term|Isigny|pos=a place in [[Calvados]]|lang=fro}}.
* In modern use, it is also derived from the name of a well-known person called [[w:Walt Disney|Walt Disney]].

